# Synthetic song clips for the beatmapper DSP benchmarks (regenerate: bin/gen-songs.bash).
# <file.wav> [seconds= sr= ch= bpm= a4x10= seed= bpc= roots= minors=]
# Clips are tiled at run time (SynthSong.loadTiled) to the requested length; choose
# seconds as a whole number of chord cycles where possible.
